# BUG-009 — Checkout Allows Empty Required Fields

## Bug Type
Validation Bug

## Module
Checkout

## Severity
High

## Priority
High

## Steps to Reproduce
1. Add a product to the cart.
2. Open Checkout.
3. Leave required customer information empty.
4. Click Place Order.

## Expected Result
The system should display validation messages and prevent order submission.

## Actual Result
The checkout process proceeds without properly validating required fields.

